  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nUNYIELDER unites Looter-Shooters, Movement FPS and Character Action Games in an infinitely expandable Roguelite to create Spectacular, Absurd and Chaotic Boss battles.<p></p>\n<p><b>EREBUS, THE CAPITAL CITY OF ANTARCTICA, 1972</b> – A hotspot for apocalyptic-level events, after decades of existential torment, EREBUS finally collapsed. Towering derelicts of the once concrete utopia are buried in dunes of rust: “PNEUMA”, a by-product of entropic weapons; Man-made “Heaven”.<br>\n<b>CARVE YOUR PATH</b> – Journey through the war-torn lands of EREBUS, Defeat enemies, loot weapons, grow in power.<br>\n<b>A WALKING CATACLYSM OF YOUR OWN DESIGN</b> – Wield RUPTURE, RHAPSODY and REVERIE, volatile sources of ineffable power. Unleash your unique brand of devastation with bizarre weapons and perks.<br>\n<b>BUILD YOUR FINAL BOSS</b> – Scavenge the data of slain enemies and build your own Pattern of machine-god punching bag. Unique combinations alter the boss fight.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><i>BREAK THE GAME</i>: Like any good toy, play with it vigorously, experiment. (and have fun)\n</li><li><i>EMBODY TENACITY</i>: The further you go, the more dangerous the world becomes. (but so do you)\n</li><li><i>DOMINATION</i>: Gather unique weapons and perks to empower your build and playstyle. (or just pick the weird stuff, who’s going to stop you?)\n</li><li><i>BYOBoss</i>: With parts from enemies you defeat, customize the Final Boss.\n</li></ul>\n",
